Day 30/100 of Code: Building a Data Science Web App with Flask! 🎯

Today, I combined HTML, CSS, Python, and Data Science to create a Flask-powered interactive dashboard! 📊

What I Built?
✅ Processed customer purchase data using Pandas 🐼
✅ Performed data visualization using Matplotlib & Seaborn 📈
✅ Developed a simple Flask web app to display insights 🌐
✅ Styled it with HTML & CSS for a clean UI 🎨

How It Works?
🔹 Flask Backend loads and processes data
🔹 Python generates analytics & saves visualizations
🔹 HTML & CSS display the graphs in a user-friendly dashboard

